  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Upload one or more patients' mRNA/miRNA/methylation/CNV profiles, get a predicted molecular subtype with a confidence tier from XGBoost or one of two deep fusion models, read which features drove each call and which KEGG pathways the pathway-aware model weights most for the cohort, compare the models' cross-validated performance, and turn raw per-modality lab files into a prediction-ready row. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
